    {
      "id": "2071705304249856501",
      "text": "Dude. Months and months of the iOS app being tested in the repo and y’all release an iOS app that has crashed on me 5 times on 3 different screens lol. Should’ve just had the version from February go public if you were going to release this?\n\nClicking overview -> guaranteed crash. Sending a chat message has a 50/50 chance of locking up my keyboard and the app ui. Sending a voice message has no visual indicator of what’s been recorded so far. \n\nThis is somehow worse than the slop openclaw iOS app I one shotted overnight the day before Claude blocked openclaw and that is truly insane",
