    {
      "id": "2071578992897818831",
      "text": "In light of the German government giving some random guys €180k to develop a new version of Nokia 3310 snake I one-shotted it with claude, with a single sentence.\n\n\"Build a replica of Nokia's 3310 Snake and host it on Prisma Compute\". \n\nThere you go. It is clunky, but it works. https://t.co/CwDyWs8XTP\n\nNow give me 180k.",
      "author": {
