    {
      "id": "2071368119927316814",
      "text": "maxfusion is predicting EVERY World Cup knockout match with a creative pipeline I built in Flows🔮\n\nClaude one-shotted the whole thing for me via maxfusion API, I didn't even touch the canvas.\n\nWe're going on a 32-match marathon, maxfusion prediction before every kickoff.\n\nIt already called the opening knockout game: South Africa vs Canada → Canada✅\n\nAnd it films me lifting the trophy as MVP of whoever wins, using Seedance 2.0 🏆\n\nFollow. We're doing this the whole tournament. \n\nCheck out the flow👇",
