    {
      "id": "2070993838861328502",
      "text": "I'm getting Claude Opus design vibes off of GLM-5.2 but the app it one shotted had bugs most other models in that class don't tend to have on that test, anymore.\n\nIt did decently on my Czech jablko test but lost track of diacritics in the test prompt and corrected an error that wasn't there while sliding into non-Czech. \n\nAnd it completely choked on my vertical text puzzle that frontier LLMs have been able to solve since o3. It's still spinning its wheels 20 mins in while Gemini 3.5 Flash gave me the correct answer in 49 seconds.\n\nSo, I'm skeptical of the benchmarks. Definitely does not have that big model smell.",
      "author": {
        "id": "29427973",
        "name": "Dominik Lukes",
        "screenName": "techczech",
