    {
      "id": "2070964374693671039",
      "text": "AI + spreadsheets can get you weirdly far.\n\nI needed a simple system to track expenses, P&L, and a few stats across my projects.\n\nStarted looking at open-source options. Some were good, but the setup was annoying and the UX was bad.\n\nThen I realized a simple sheet was more than enough.\n\nOne-shotted it with Claude and double-tested the formulas.\n\nProbably took less time than comparing tools.",
