      "lang": "en",
      "score": null,
      "quotedTweet": {
        "id": "2069167494661648603",
        "text": "AI builder Ras Mic on the agentic-loops hype:\n\n\"human in the loop is the best loop.\"\n\nin a ~20-min pod he argues that \"fire a loop and walk away\" - the thing top builders keep flexing - is a token-burning trap for anyone not on an unlimited plan.\n\nhis exhibit A: Peter Steinberger's screenshot - $1.3M in tokens in a single month.\n\nthe one place a loop actually works? a tight code-review loop, scored 1–5, that never ships below a 4.\n\nworth more than a $500 vibe-coding course. watch today ↓",
